title: "Discopilot"
abstract: "Discopilot brings the Microsoft Teams Copilot experience to Discord — natively. It records voice conversations with built-in consent, transcribes and translates in real time, recaps meetings, and answers questions grounded in your server's data, all through Discord's native UX."
